e":"If the animal uses the Support action, the only other actions it can use on this turn are basic [move](link_trait_1505) actions to get into position to take advantage of the Support benefits; if it has already used any other action this turn, it can’t Support you.","after_template":"If the animal uses the [Support](link_feat_34004) action, the only other actions it can use on this turn are basic [move](link_trait_1505) actions to get into position to take advantage of the [Support](link_feat_34004) benefits; if it has already used any other action this turn, it can’t [Support](link_feat_34004) you.","bindings":[]}],"aliases":[],"url_aliases":["https://2e.aonprd.com/Companions.aspx?ID=55"]},{"table":"item","type":"item","uuid":"2231238570519876","name":"Phistophilus Fiddle","row_100":{"name":"Phistophilus Fiddle","bulk":"1","level":3,"rarity":"UNIQUE","description":"**Aspects** artistry and fiend\n\n* * *\n\nMade of pure gold with platinum strings, the phistophilus fiddle shouldn't be able to play a note, but play it does, so beautifully that it can move almost any audience. The fiddle was stolen from the [contract devil](link_creature_10242) who created it, and the cunning fiend still wants to reclaim the instrument. Fiendish misfortunes often befall its owners, allowing it to switch hands. The fiddle is a handheld [virtuoso instrument](link_item_7604).\n\n* * *\n\n**Minor Gifts** [little helper](link_feat_29519), [muse](link_feat_28851) (Performance)\n\n**Major Gifts** [charming](link_feat_28852), [fiendish bargain](link_feat_29520)\n\n**Grand Gift** [artistic perfection](link_feat_28854) (Performance)","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"size":"MEDIUM","craft_requirements":null,"usage":"held in 2 hands","meta_data":{"bulk":{},"charges":{},"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"unselectable":false,"starfinder":{},"quantity":1,"source":{"book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"205","url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2408"}},"operations":[{"id":"6dc958e0-8