. The fiddle is a handheld [virtuoso instrument](link_item_7604).\n\n* * *\n\n**Minor Gifts** [little helper](link_feat_29519), [muse](link_feat_28851) (Performance)\n\n**Major Gifts** [charming](link_feat_28852), [fiendish bargain](link_feat_29520)\n\n**Grand Gift** [artistic perfection](link_feat_28854) (Performance)","bindings":[{"uuid":"2231238570519876","table":"item","name":"Phistophilus Fiddle","content_source_id":16}]}],"aliases":[{"family":"Phistophilus Fiddle","names":["phistophilus fiddle"],"citation_ids":[2408,4937]}],"url_aliases":["https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2408"]},{"table":"item","type":"item","uuid":"3341821474558316","name":"Animal Pseudopod","row_100":{"name":"Animal Pseudopod","bulk":null,"level":0,"rarity":"COMMON","description":"An [agile](link_trait_1569) pseudopod attack.","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"size":"MEDIUM","craft_requirements":"","usage":"","meta_data":{"bulk":{},"group":"brawling","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"d6","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"B"},"charges":{},"category":"unarmed_attack","material":{},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"unselectable":true,"source":{"book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"106","url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Companions.aspx?ID=55"}},"operations":[],"content_source_id":16,"version":"1.0","uuid":"3341821474558316","price":{},"traits":[2398,1569],"availability":null},"row_101":{"name":"Animal Pseudopod","bulk":null,"level":0,"rarity":"COMMON","description":"An [agile](link_trait_1569) pseudopod attack.","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"size":"MEDIUM","craft_requirements":"","usage":"","meta_data":{"bulk":{},"group":"brawling","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"d6","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"B"},"charges":{},"category":"unarmed_attack","material":{},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"unselectable":true,"source":{"book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"106","url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Companions.aspx?ID=55"}},"operations":[],"content_source_id":16,"version":"1.0","uuid":"3341821474558316","price":{},"traits":[2398,1569],"availability":null},"binding":null,"symbolic_fields":[],"role":"prerequisite","sha256_100":"6c3ef91452e5f097e60b45845152de471100304e6ba21d95515f1d9a9681766b","sha256_101":"6c3ef91452e5f097e60b45845152de471100304e6ba21d95515f1d9a9681766b","sha256_before_100":"6c3ef91452e5f097e60b45845152de471100304e6ba21d95515f1d9a9681766b","content_source_id":16,"display_fields":[],"aliases":[],"url_aliases":["https://2e.aonprd.com/Companions.aspx?ID=55"]},{"table":"item","type":"item","uuid":"8338913217540863","name":"Sleuth's Pipe","row_100":{"name":"Sleuth's Pipe","bulk":"0.1","level":3,"rarity":"UNIQUE","description":"**Aspects** luck and mind\n\n* * *\n\nA famed detective once owned the long, curved sleuth's pipe, taking it with them on investigations, keeping it in hand or mouth while cogitating. The pipe might have passed down through generations. Or, when an owner dies without heirs, it could go up for auction, be given to family friends, or remain at the scene of a crime to be found later. The sleuth's pipe has sapience that eventually awakens, allowing the [relic](link_trait_3460) to act as a helpful assistant in investigations.\n\nEven while this sapience sleeps within the pipe, it grants you a +1 item bonus to Perception checks to [Sense Motive](link_action_19847), and if you're an [investigator](link_class_110), any checks you make to [Pursue a Lead](link_feat_30995).\n\n* * *\n\n**Minor Gifts** [beginner's luck](link_feat_29695), [repository of knowledge](link_feat_29711)\n\n**Major Gifts** [intelligent relic](link_feat_29688), [steal luck](link_feat_29699)\n\n**Grand Gift** [mental bastion](link_feat_29714)","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"size":"MEDIUM","craft_requirements":null,"usage":"held in 1 hand","meta_data":{"bulk":{},"charges":{},"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"unselectable":false,"starfinde