k mechanisms to maneuver about. The chair comes equipped with [wheel blades](link_item_15502), and portions of its frame contain [sterling artisan's tools](link_item_6724). The inventor's chair might be a family heirloom or a gift from someone who inherited it. It could instead sit unused in its inventor's abandoned estate, awaiting another user.\n\n* * *\n\n**Minor Gifts** [emotion surge](link_feat_29512), [muse](link_feat_28851) (Crafting)\n\n**Major Gifts** [emotion conduit](link_feat_29514), [enthralling](link_feat_28853)\n\n**Grand Gift** [artistic perfection](link_feat_28854) (Crafting)","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"size":"MEDIUM","craft_requirements":null,"usage":"","meta_data":{"bulk":{},"charges":{},"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"unselectable":false,"starfinder":{},"quantity":1,"source":{"book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"205","url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2407"}},"operations":[{"id":"5378776c-43b7-4c2c-b4cf-77fe30319050","type":"addBonusToValue","data":{"variable":"SKILL_CRAFTING","value":1,"type":"item","text":"to Craft items using the integrated artisan's toolkit"}}],"content_source_id":16,"version":"1.0","uuid":"8452974248299523","price":null,"traits":[1504,3460],"availability":null},"row_101":{"name":"Inventor's Chair","bulk":"3","level":4,"rarity":"UNIQUE","description":"**Aspects** [artistry](link_trait_3483) and [emotion](link_trait_3489) (dedication)\n\n* * *\n\nInitially crafted by a gifted inventor who no longer had the use of their legs, the [inventor's chair](link_item_{{allocated_id:8452974248299523}}) is a [traveler's chair](link_item_7904). It's a marvel of engineering, utilizing clockwork mechanisms to maneuver about. The chair comes equipped with [wheel blades](link_item_15502), and portions of its frame contain [sterling artisan's tools](link_item_6724). The [inventor's chair](link_item_{{allocated_id:8452974248299523}}) might be a family heirloom or a gift from someone who inherited it. It could instead sit unused in its inventor's abandoned estate, awaiting another user.\n\n* * *\n\n**Minor Gifts** [emotion surge](link_feat_29512), [muse](link_feat_28851) (Crafting)\n\n**Major Gifts** [emotion conduit](link_feat_29514), [enthralling](link_feat_28853)\n\n**Grand Gift** [artistic perfection](link_feat_28854) (Crafting)","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"size":"MEDIUM","craft_requirements":null,"usage":"","meta_data":{"bulk":{},"charges":{},"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"unselectable":false,"starfinder":{},"quantity":1,"source":{"book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"205","url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2407"}},"operations":[{"id":"5378776c-43b7-4c2c-b4cf-77fe30319050","type":"addBonusToValue","data":{"variable":"SKILL_CRAFTING","value":1,"type":"item","text":"to Craft items using the integrated artisan's toolkit"}}],"content_source_id":16,"version":"1.0","uuid":"8452974248299523","price":null,"traits":[1504,3460],"availability":null},"binding":null,"symbolic_fields":[{"path":["description"],"uuid":"8452974248299523","table":"item","type":"item","token":"{{allocated_id:8452974248299523}}","runtime_validation":"exact unique global UUID; positive actual ID; complete target template/source domain; replace only exact helper URL in this reviewed field"}],"role":"prerequisite","phase101_keys":["description"],"sha256_100":"b086d7cb7f30dbd5ef3adab18908e82e62dd03784f2d0c9ab8204dac2ad93408","sha256_101":"d407c16241056d29916195f8188d7be9b3c97d52e4697cef128b9a8373569167","sha256_before_100":"b086d7cb7f30dbd5ef3adab18908e82e62dd03784f2d0c9ab8204dac2ad93408","phase101_before_sha256":"d4dd5d17380d90343094260d647fd35d37cc5cde099ff00ba52ccff05cb4aaae","phase101_after_sha256":"168e93174b9210bd84dc97b453d26c54de12a2c198fea99d1520d6cc8e8e012a","content_source_id":16,"display_fields":[{"path":["description"],"before":"**Aspects** artistry and emotion (dedication)\n\n* * *\n\nInitially crafted by a gifted inventor who no longer had the use of their legs, the inventor's chair is a [traveler's chair](link_item_7904). It's a marvel of engineering, utilizing clockwork mechanisms to maneuver about. The chair comes equipped with [wheel blades](link_item_15502), and portions of its frame contain [sterling artisan's tools](link_item_6724). The inventor's chair might be a family heirloom or a gift from someone who inherited it. It could instead sit unused in its inventor's abandoned estate, awaiting another user.\n\n* * *\n\n**Minor Gifts** [emotion surge](link_feat_29512), [muse](link_feat_28851) (Crafting)\n\n**Major Gifts** [emotion conduit](link_feat_29514), [enthralling](link_feat_28853)\n\n**Grand Gift** [artistic perfection](link_feat_28854) (Crafting)","after_template":"**Aspects** [artistry](link_trait_3483) and [emotion](link_trait_3489) (dedication)\n\n* * *\n\nInitially crafted by a gifted inventor who no longer had the use of their legs, the [inventor's chair](link_item_{{allocated_id:8452974248299523}}) is a [traveler's chair](link_item_7904). It's a marvel of engineering, utilizing clockwork mechanisms to maneuver about. The chair comes equipped with [wheel blades](link_item_15502), and portions of its frame contain [sterling artisan's tools](link_item_6724). The [inventor's chair](link_item_{{allocated_id:8452974248299523}}) might be a family heirloom or a gift from someone who inherited it. It could instead sit unused in its inventor's abandoned estate, awaiting another user.\n\n* * *\n\n**Minor Gifts** [emotion surge](link_feat_29512), [muse](link_feat_28851) (Crafting)\n\n**Major Gifts** [emotion conduit](link_feat_29514), [enthralling](link_feat_28853)\n\n**Grand Gift** [artistic perfection](link_feat_28854) (Crafting)","bindings":[{"uuid":"8452974248299523","table":"item","name":"Inventor's Chair","content_source_id":16}]}],"aliases":[{"family":"Inventor's Chair","names":["inventor s chair"],"citation_ids":[2407,4936]}],"url_aliases":["https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2407"]},{"table":"item","type":"item","uuid":"8797079847352829","name":"Watch of Lost Ages","row_100":{"name":"Watch of Lost Ages","bulk":"0.1","level":3,"rarity":"UNIQUE","description":"**Aspects** emotion (misery) and time\n\n* * *\n\nThe origins of the watch of lost ages, a silver pocket watch, are enigmatic. Its construction matches no known culture, and its appearance shifts back and forth from battered and tarnished to shiny and new without cause or apparent reason. The watch exudes a sense of melancholy and loss, and anyone holding it is acutely aware of the impermanence of all things and the march of time, moving ever forward.\n\nThis [relic](link_trait_3460) might show up in a mysterious ruin or spontaneously appear in a spellcaster's hand after they cast a [time](link_trait_4185) spell. The [relic](link_trait_3460) grants you a +1 item bonus to [Recall Knowledge](link_action_19753) about historical subjects.\n\n* * *\n\n**Minor Gifts** [fervor](link_feat_29513), [sands of the hourglass](link_feat_29806)\n\n**Major Gifts** [fervent spell](link_feat_29515), [temporal pulse](link_feat_29808)\n\n**Grand Gift** [time reversal](link_feat_29810)","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"size":"MEDIUM","craft_requirements":null,"usage":"held in 1 hand","meta_data":{"bulk":{},"charges":{},"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"unselectable":false,"starfinder":{},"quantity":1,"source":{"book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"205","url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2410"}},"operations":[],"content_source_id":16,"version":"1.0","uuid":"8797079847352829","price":null,"traits":[1504,3460],"availability":null},"row_101":{"name":"Watch of Lost Ages","bulk":"0.1","level":3,"rarity":"UNIQUE","description":"**Aspects** [emotion](link_trait_3489) (misery) and [time](link_trait_3501)\n\n* * *\n\nThe origins of the [watch of lost ages](link_item_{{allocated_id:8797079847352829}}), a silver pocket watch, are enigmatic. Its construction matches no known culture, and its appearance shifts back and forth from battered and tarnished to shiny and new without cause or apparent reason. The watch exudes a sense of melancholy and loss, and anyone holding it is acutely aware of the impermanence of all things and the march of time, moving ever forward.\n\nThis [relic](link_trait_3460) might show up in a mysterious ruin or spontaneously appear in a spellcaster's hand after they cast a [time](link_trait_4185) spell. The [relic](link_trait_3460) grants you a +1 item bonus to [Recall Knowledge](link_action_19753) about historical subjects.\n\n* * *\n\n**Minor Gifts** [fervor](link_feat_29513), [sands of the hourglass](link_feat_29806)\n\n**Major Gifts** [fervent spell](link_feat_29515), [temporal pulse](link_feat_29808)\n\n**Grand Gift** [time reversal](link_feat_29810)","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"size":"MEDIUM","craft_requirements":null,"usage":"held in 1 hand","meta_data":{"bulk":{},"charges":{},"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"unselectable":false,"starfinder":{},"quantity":1,"source":{"book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"205","url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2410"}},"operations":[],"content_source_id":16,"version":"1.0","uuid":"8797079847352829","price":null,"traits":[1504,3460],"availability":null},"binding":null,"symbolic_fields":[{"path":["description"],"uuid":"8797079847352829","table":"item","type":"item","token":"{{allocated_id:8797079847352829}}","runtime_validation":"exact unique global UUID; positive actual ID; complete target template/source domain; replace only exact helper URL in this reviewed field"}],"role":"prerequisite","phase101_keys":["description"],"sha256_100":"74355c7fc2f5702b67dd7547711adc8cfe9a04a8c9176da7051983c4a8bd6ce6","sha256_101":"31323f3245b779616d27707dae028825f3a9b82e0feb0c7452c5de95984a28cb","sha256_before_100":"74355c7fc2f5702b67dd7547711adc8cfe9a04a8c9176da7051983c4a8bd6ce6","phase101_before_sha256":"9ca7e71aa5e9867a93001dbe9a15e0cc5e8c7fc4ba329538bd29369b2a7ebec2","phase101_after_sha256":"313d992d6ab7ab7a96a4df0a97429343ab811785e5a8d6968ca0a01c0584d093","content_source_id":16,"display_fields":[{"path":["description"],"before":"**Aspects** emotion (misery) and time\n\n* * *\n\nThe origins of the watch of lost ages, a silver pocket watch, are enigmatic. Its construction matches no known culture, and its appearance shifts back and forth from battered and tarnished to shiny and new without cause or apparent reason. The watch exudes a sense of melancholy and loss, and anyone holding it is acutely aware of the impermanence of all things and the march of time, moving ever forward.\n\nThis [relic](link_trait_3460) might show up in a mysterious ruin or spontaneously appear in a spellcaster's hand after they cast a [time](link_trait_4185) spell. The [relic](link_trait_3460) grants you a +1 item bonus to [Recall Knowledge](link_action_19753) about historical subjects.\n\n* * *\n\n**Minor Gifts** [fervor](link_feat_29513), [sands of the hourglass](link_feat_29806)\n\n**Major Gifts** [fervent spell](link_feat_29515), [temporal pulse](link_feat_29808)\n\n**Grand Gift** [time reversal](link_feat_29810)","after_template":"**Aspects** [emotion](link_trait_3489) (misery) and [time](link_trait_3501)\n\n* * *\n\nThe origins of the [watch of lost ages](link_item_{{allocated_id:8797079847352829}}), a silver pocket watch, are enigmatic. Its construction matches no known culture, and its appearance shifts back and forth from battered and tarnished to shiny and new without cause or apparent reason. The watch exudes a sense of melancholy and loss, and anyone holding it is acutely aware of the impermanence of all things and the march of time, moving ever forward.\n\nThis [relic](link_trait_3460) might show up in a mysterious ruin or spontaneously appear in a spellcaster's hand after they cast a [time](link_trait_4185) spell. The [relic](link_trait_3460) grants you a +1 item bonus to [Recall Knowledge](link_action_19753) about historical subjects.\n\n* * *\n\n**Minor Gifts** [fervor](link_feat_29513), [sands of the hourglass](link_feat_29806)\n\n**Major Gifts** [fervent spell](link_feat_29515), [temporal pulse](link_feat_29808)\n\n**Grand Gift** [time reversal](link_feat_29810)","bindings":[{"uuid":"8797079847352829","table":"item","name":"Watch of Lost Ages","content_source_id":16}]}],"aliases":[{"family":"Watch of Lost Ages","names":["watch of lost ages"],"citation_ids":[2410,4939]}],"url_aliases":["https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2410"]},{"table":"item","type":"item","uuid":"944653220160268","name":"Fortune's Favor","row_100":{"name":"Fortune's Favor","bulk":"0","level":3,"rarity":"UNIQUE","description":"**Aspects** luck and mind\n\n* * *\n\nBlessed by Nivi Rhombodazzle, this striking silver necklace is adorned with sparkling sapphires that draw the eye of any who see it. Over the years, this necklace has appeared in many paintings and illustrations, usually around the neck of a carefree and daring adventurer or a stylish rake gambling vast sums of coin. Finding this [relic](link_trait_3460) is always seen as a sign of great fortune to come, but when that luck runs out, the necklace is lost just as quickly.\n\nWearing the [relic](link_trait_3460), you quickly realize how distracting it can be, granting you a +1 item bonus on Deception checks made to [Feint](link_action_19633) and on Games Lore checks made to gamble or determine the outcome of a game of chance.\n\n* * *\n\n**Minor Gifts** [beginner's luck](link_feat_29695), [whammy](link_feat_29697)\n\n**Major Gifts** [clean luck](link_feat_29698), [perception filter](link_feat_29712)\n\n**Grand Gift** [against all odds](link_feat_29700)","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"size":"MEDIUM","craft_requirements":null,"usage":"worn","meta_data":{"bulk":{},"charges":{},"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"unselectable":false,"starfinder":{},"quantity":1,"source":{"book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"204","url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2406"}},"operations":[{"id":"c013f74b-c390-486c-8af2-898799d53f4d","ty