lectable":false},"operations":[],"description":"A durable material when properly treated, [bone](link_item_15403) can replace wood and metal when creating armor, shields, and weapons. The statistics for [bone](link_item_15403) are applicable to a variety of other sturdy [animal](link_trait_2409)-based products, such as chitin, horn, ivory, coral, and shell, which can also be classified as [bone](link_item_15403) for the purposes of determining item statistics. [Bone](link_item_15403) elements from certain [beasts](link_trait_2422), like the horn of a [unicorn](link_creature_10352) or the spikes of a manticore, may even yield [magical](link_trait_1504) properties when worked by a skilled crafter.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":""},"binding":null,"symbolic_fields":[],"role":"insert","sha256_100":"3d6c33ce641e8915d3db0bb1a26205baa98788b695615e966e0ac46b83ee8164","sha256_101":"3d6c33ce641e8915d3db0bb1a26205baa98788b695615e966e0ac46b83ee8164","content_source_id":16,"display_fields":[],"aliases":[],"url_aliases":["https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2358"]}],"sources":[{"id":1,"name":"Player Core","sha256_before_100":"8eee83c9e137effc8d07657c96f7af1ac2a176196d6d8348b086db4943133dca","sha256":"8eee83c9e137effc8d07657c96f7af1ac2a176196d6d8348b086db4943133dca","sha256_101":"8eee83c9e137effc8d07657c96f7af1ac2a176196d6d8348b086db4943133dca","url_aliases":["https://paizo.com/products/btq02eoj?Pathfinder-Player-Core"]},{"id":3,"name":"Common Core","sha256_before_100":"9275926d851bee959f724cec955443b94ce2a98a8fa548cce550c075439fa14c","sha256":"9275926d851bee959f724cec955443b94ce2a98a8fa548cce550c075439fa14c","sha256_101":"9275926d851bee959f724cec955443b94ce2a98a8fa548cce550c075439fa14c","url_aliases":[]},{"id":7,"name":"GM Core","sha256_before_100":"fc252ae093ac56fed9ec6807dae313b58376d3b4c8333a4fa1584951b72fb6e1","sha256":"fc252ae093ac56fed9ec6807dae313b58376d3b4c8333a4fa1584951b72fb6e1","sha256_101":"fc252ae093ac56fed9ec6807dae313b58376d3b4