its a constant low hum, vibrating slightly when touched. The spell attack roll of any spell cast by Activating this item is +13, and the spell DC is 29.\n\n*   **Armor** You gain resistance 10 to [sonic](link_trait_1484) damage and a +2 item bonus to saving throws against effects with the [auditory](link_trait_1469) or [sonic](link_trait_1484) trait.\n    \n*   **Weapon** After you cast a [sonic](link_trait_1484) spell by activating the fork, the weapon reverberates with trapped sound waves. Your next [Strike](link_action_19856) causes the target to be deafened for 1 minute if it hits (or for 1 hour on a critical hit). If you don't make a [Strike](link_action_19856) by the end of your next turn, the sound waves dissipate with no effect.\n    \n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Effect** You cast *[bullhorn](link_spell_6722)*.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** You cast 4th-rank *[noise blast](link_spell_4742)*.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** You cast *[painful vibrations](link_spell_8995)*.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12325,"bulk":"0","name":"Resonating Fork (Major)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2307628812193819","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":1800},"usage":"affixed to armor or a weapon","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504,1484,2570],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4771","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"128"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0,"spellheart_casting":{"dc":29,"attack":19}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:31.489653+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This two-pronged fork of metal emits a constant low hum, vibrating slightly when touched. The spell attack roll of any spell cast by Activating this item is +19, and the spell DC is 29.\n\n*   **Armor** You gain resistance 10 to [sonic](link_trait_1484) damage and a +2 item bonus to saving throws against effects with the [auditory](link_trait_1469) or [sonic](link_trait_1484) trait.\n    \n*   **Weapon** After you cast a [sonic](link_trait_1484) spell by activating the fork, the weapon reverberates with trapped sound waves. Your next [Strike](link_action_19856) causes the target to be deafened for 1 minute if it hits (or for 1 hour on a critical hit). If you don't make a [Strike](link_action_19856) by the end of your next turn, the sound waves dissipate with no effect.\n    \n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Effect** You cast *[bullhorn](link_spell_6722)*.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** You cast 4th-rank *[noise blast](link_spell_4742)*.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** You cast *[painful vibrations](link_spell_8995)*.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null}}]}$source_corrections102$::jsonb as spec),
